{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Cornline VR is a dynamic VR game in which your goal is to stop scarecrows from escaping the field. Arm yourself, aim accurately and score as many points as possible in each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the highest possible score on the leaderboard, unlock new maps and weapons and face increasingly difficult opponents. Each session is a new chance to improve your record and survive the next wave of attacking terrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With modifications, you can change the ratio of points and break your own records.The perfect game for party nights under spontaneous competition.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851340?t=1757890291","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851340/7f3d39f7147ac4735bd12185879d4ddf3738f148/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757890291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851340/54d5f791562baf0b7bb8ff26416e385ac1c31d12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757890291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851340/54d5f791562baf0b7bb8ff26416e385ac1c31d12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757890291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Cornline VR is a dynamic VR game in which your goal is to stop scarecrows from escaping the field. Arm yourself, aim accurately and score as many points as possible in each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the highest possible score on the leaderboar